🚀 Main AI/ML Workflow

The most important workflow is:


Login to AWS
      ↓
Use IAM User
      ↓
Choose AWS Service
      ↓
AWS SageMaker AI
      ↓
Jupyter Notebook Lab
      ↓
Data Preprocessing
      ↓
Model Training
      ↓
Model Building
      ↓
Model Evaluation
      ↓
Deployment
      ↓
Endpoint
      ├── Server-Based → Charged per hour
      │
      └── Serverless → Charge per prediction

